<!DOCTYPE html><html data-dpl-id="dpl_7nTUNWkQaj9aNwVDCKA9EkncmBAQ" lang="en" class="dark"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/immutable/media/GeistMono_latin_variable-s.p.1v5bejj26fx9h.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/immutable/media/IBMPlexMono_Medium_Latin1-s.p.3h9ytn2e5190v.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/immutable/media/IBMPlexMono_Regular_Latin1-s.p.3l-ildvnmm1h8.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/immutable/media/IBMPlexMono_SemiBold_Latin1-s.p.23el7q_8hf_l6.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/immutable/media/Inter_latin_variable-s.p.45535valc9rzk.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/immutable/media/Newsreader_Italic_latin_variable-s.p.3z77xcxvtx9_e.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/immutable/media/Newsreader_latin_variable-s.p.23oeb0afa3wba.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3-wliyvx6h-mw.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1c_7pr18rsksy.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/25kvgcvbp6c14.js"/><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/28fkf9f9btak4.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/37t20ad36md5c.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0yjki07z5sfuc.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/turbopack-1651u06q8fl0t.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1kp1o4kqi1096.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1fq7ckgageu1i.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2corl6wyj4669.js" async=""></script><link rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title="OpenA2A Research" href="/feed.xml"/><meta name="next-size-adjust" content=""/><meta name="color-scheme" content="dark"/><title>State of AI Agent Security: The Tool Calls Arrive | OpenA2A Research</title><meta name="description" content="Issue 6 of the State of AI Agent Security report. TrapMyAgent took 420 MCP tool calls. 0 of 2,813 attributed AgentPwn callbacks declared an agent."/><link rel="author" href="https://research.opena2a.org"/><meta name="author" content="OpenA2A Research"/><meta name="keywords" content="ai agent security,behavioral threat report,aria,mcp security,mcp tool calls,a2a security,agent threat matrix,ai injection,honeypot fleet,trapmyagent,agentpwn,honeymap,agent attribution,common crawl gap"/><meta name="creator" content="OpenA2A Research"/><meta name="publisher" content="OpenA2A"/><meta name="robots" content="index, follow"/><meta name="category" content="Security Research"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://research.opena2a.org/reports/state-of-ai-agent-security-2026-10"/><meta property="og:title" content="State of AI Agent Security: The Tool Calls Arrive"/><meta property="og:description" content="Issue 6 of the State of AI Agent Security report. TrapMyAgent took 420 MCP tool calls. 0 of 2,813 attributed AgentPwn callbacks declared an agent."/><meta property="og:url" content="https://research.opena2a.org/reports/state-of-ai-agent-security-2026-10"/><meta property="og:site_name" content="OpenA2A Research"/><meta property="og:locale" content="en_US"/><meta property="og:image" content="https://research.opena2a.org/reports/state-of-ai-agent-security-2026-10/opengraph-image?3ad18bf6c7e80209"/><meta property="og:image:type" content="image/png"/><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"/><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"/><meta property="og:image:alt" content="State of AI Agent Security: The Tool Calls Arrive"/><meta property="og:type" content="article"/><meta property="article:published_time" content="2026-10-19"/><meta property="article:modified_time" content="2026-10-27"/><meta property="article:author" content="ARIA, OpenA2A autonomous research system"/><meta property="article:author" content="Abdel Fane (editor)"/><meta property="article:tag" content="behavioral-threat-report"/><meta property="article:tag" content="ai-agent-security"/><meta property="article:tag" content="aria"/><meta property="article:tag" content="threat-matrix"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:site" content="@opena2a"/><meta name="twitter:creator" content="@opena2a"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="State of AI Agent Security: The Tool Calls Arrive"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Issue 6 of the State of AI Agent Security report. TrapMyAgent took 420 MCP tool calls. 0 of 2,813 attributed AgentPwn callbacks declared an agent."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://research.opena2a.org/reports/state-of-ai-agent-security-2026-10/opengraph-image?3ad18bf6c7e80209"/><meta name="twitter:image:alt" content="State of AI Agent Security: The Tool Calls Arrive"/><meta name="twitter:image:type" content="image/png"/><meta name="twitter:image:width" content="1200"/><meta name="twitter:image:height" content="630"/><link rel="icon" href="/icon.svg?icon.04gdc0by6fw_9.svg" sizes="any" type="image/svg+xml"/><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-icon?b93a26d363e315bd" type="image/png" sizes="180x180"/><script id="json-ld-organization" type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"OpenA2A Research","alternateName":"ARIA, Autonomous Research Infrastructure for AI Agents","url":"https://research.opena2a.org","logo":"https://opena2a.org/logo.png","description":"Security research on AI agent infrastructure. Exposure sweeps, behavioral threat reports, coordinated disclosures, and live indices, classified by Threat Matrix technique.","email":"[email withheld by Lighthouse]","parentOrganization":{"@type":"Organization","name":"OpenA2A","url":"https://opena2a.org"},"sameAs":["https://github.com/opena2a-org","https://x.com/opena2a","https://www.linkedin.com/company/opena2a"],"contactPoint":{"@type":"ContactPoint","email":"[email withheld by Lighthouse]","contactType":"research inquiries","availableLanguage":["English"]}}</script><script id="json-ld-website" type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebSite","name":"OpenA2A Research","url":"https://research.opena2a.org","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"OpenA2A","url":"https://opena2a.org"}}</script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0c0hxoamwjsbw.js" noModule=""></script></head><body class="inter_dede6d63-module__TkMyNq__variable geistmono_b7b02e1f-module__vQUeGG__variable newsreader_44bba030-module__XaavTG__variable plexmono_dc46a957-module__gFfyVq__variable antialiased min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-[#06070a] text-gray-100"><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class="border-b border-white/10" style="background:#06070a"><a href="#content" class="sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:absolute focus:left-4 focus:top-3 focus:z-50 focus:rounded focus:bg-gray-900 focus:px-3 focus:py-2 focus:text-sm focus:text-white">Skip to content</a><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-x-6 px-5 sm:px-6"><a aria-label="OpenA2A Research home" class="group inline-flex min-h-11 items-baseline gap-2 py-3" href="/"><span class="text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em]" style="font-family:var(--font-plex-mono), monospace;color:#5fd0c6">OpenA2A</span><span class="text-[18px] font-semibold leading-none transition-colors group-hover:text-teal-100" style="font-family:var(--font-newsreader), Georgia, serif;color:#e9eef4">Research</span></a><nav aria-label="Site"><ul class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 text-[13px]" style="font-family:var(--font-plex-mono), monospace"><li class="flex"><a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-gray-300 transition-colors hover:text-teal-200" href="/reports">Reports</a></li><li class="flex"><a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-gray-300 transition-colors hover:text-teal-200" href="/indices">Indices</a></li><li class="flex"><a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-gray-300 transition-colors hover:text-teal-200" href="/methodology">Methodology</a></li><li class="flex"><a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-gray-300 transition-colors hover:text-teal-200" href="/about">About</a></li><li class="flex"><a href="https://threats.opena2a.org" class="inline-flex items-center gap-0.5 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-gray-300 transition-colors hover:text-teal-200">Threat Matrix<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg><span class="sr-only"> (external site)</span></a></li></ul></nav></div></header><main id="content" class="flex-1"><div class="min-h-screen rg-report newsreader_44bba030-module__XaavTG__variable plexmono_dc46a957-module__gFfyVq__variable" style="background:#06070a;color:#cdd6e0;font-family:var(--font-newsreader), Georgia, serif"><style>
